		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Lean, wiry, an angel with an alley brawler's physique. Wields a flaming sword.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15 (plate mail), <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 flaming greatsword +6 (1d12+2), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Divine Aura</strong>. Hostile spells targeting the deva are DC 15. Sword and armor dissolve if slain.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pacifism</strong>. Animals and plants, CHA 15+ to take hostile actions against deva. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
